      "comment": "Narzissenkreuz: Holy Blade of Narzissenkreuz",
      "content": "In Search in the Algae Sea the Traveler, Ann, Seymour and Caterpillar reforge it before Jakob can. It cuts through wills born of water; in Rowboat's Wake it is used on the barrier at the real Annapausis, after which Narzissenkreuz says its purpose is fulfilled.",
